      "content": "QUEENSWAY 1. 5252                                                   (North Side)                                                   Nos 23 and 25 TL 0507 1/223 II                       G7 2. C16 or C17, altered.  C18 stucco front, machine tiled roof.  2 storeys.  3 flush sash windows with glazing bars to 1st floor, central 3-light window.  C19 shop fronts, altered.  Included for group value. Nos 23 to 29 (odd) and Nos 16 and 18 High Street, form a group. Listing NGR: TL0553907668"
